[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-SYA-012
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Subsystem
TITLE: Power supply
DESCRIPTION: >>>
Combines the slot 5 V and USB VBUS by Schottky diodes, protects the slot input
with a TVS diode, buffers the 5 V rail and generates 3.3 V with a step-down
converter (LDO as assembly alternative). Monitors the 5 V rail.
<<<
