[[SECTION]]
TITLE: External interfaces

[INTERFACE]
UID: KM271-SYA-100
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Electrical
TITLE: Logamatic slot (J1)
DESCRIPTION: >>>
2x6 card edge contact into the KM271 slot. Carries the slot supply, the serial
interface and the exhaust gas sensor circuit. The Logamatic side of the pin
assignment is derived from the original KM271 and is not documented by
Buderus.
<<<
SIGNALS: >>>
- Pin 1: +5 V slot supply (VPP, via R33)
- Pin 2: GND (via R34)
- Pin 3: exhaust sensor supply, about 5 V (via R35)
- Pin 4: exhaust sensor return (via R36)
- Pin 5: LM_TX, serial data from the Logamatic, 5 V logic (via R37)
- Pin 6: LM_RX, serial data to the Logamatic, 5 V logic (via R38)
- Pin 7: exhaust sensor measuring input of the Logamatic (via R39)
- Pin 8: exhaust sensor detection, 10 kOhm to sensor return (via R40)
- Pins 9-12: not used (R41-R44 not fitted)
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Assignment of pins 3, 7 and 8 is an assumption from the circuit, see
DOC/Abgassensor/README.md.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-010
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-020

