- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-031

[INTERFACE]
UID: KM271-SYA-103
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Electrical
TITLE: Extension header (J7)
DESCRIPTION: >>>
2x5 pin header, 2.54 mm. All logic signals are 3.3 V. I2C is connected
directly to the controller (no level shifter, pull-ups on the main board).
<<<
SIGNALS: >>>
- 1: +5V
- 2: +3V3
- 3: nCS (GPIO10, via 22 Ohm)
- 4: SCL (GPIO9)
- 5: MISO (GPIO13, via 22 Ohm)
- 6: SDA (GPIO16)
- 7: MOSI (GPIO11, via 22 Ohm)
- 8: nINT (GPIO14, 4.7 kOhm pull-up)
- 9: SCLK (GPIO12, via 22 Ohm)
- 10: GND
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
The W5500 extension uses pin 6 (SDA) as reset input. I2C devices and the
Ethernet extension therefore exclude each other.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-005
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-022

[INTERFACE]
UID: KM271-SYA-104
