- 4: analog input ADC1_CH6 (GPIO7)
- 5: +3V3 (via R65)
- 6: analog input ADC1_CH5 (GPIO6)
- 7: +5V (via R64)
- 8: OneWire (GPIO15)
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-021

[INTERFACE]
